SUMMARY:THIS SUNDAY | End of Summer Pickin' Party
DESCRIPTION:Sunday September 20th | 2 -10pm\n\nIt is becoming a tradition for us to host Beginning of Summer & End of Summer Full Day Sunday Pickin’ Parties. We have a full day of live music fun for Sunday September 20th.\n\n2-5PM-Suns of Stars\n\n5:15-7PM-OPEN bluegrass jam led by Zach Jones\n\n7PM-10PM-The Miller Sisters\n\n\n$15 for the Full Day of Music$10 after 5PM\nTony’s Italian Pop Up OPEN\n\n\nWith two unique locations\, built inside buildings that were previously cast aside\, One World brews with the intention of fostering nourishing interaction and artistic cultural experiences. From live music to art shows\, “One World Brewing” is born from the magic that happens when the whole becomes greater than the sum of its parts. Our taprooms are intersections for people of all walks of life and different corners of the globe\, enjoying this time and place together.  Check out our upcoming schedule: click here
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/this-sunday-end-of-summer-pickin-party/
LOCATION:One World Brewing – West\, 520 Haywood Rd\, Asheville\, North Carolina\, 28806
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music,Open MIc/Jam
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Outlook-0nfjonfl-e1789489465424.png
GEO:35.5783642;-82.5848526
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=One World Brewing – West 520 Haywood Rd Asheville North Carolina 28806;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=520 Haywood Rd:geo:-82.5848526,35.5783642
END:VEVENT
