SUMMARY:19th Annual Art in Autumn Outdoor Art Festival
DESCRIPTION:Over 100 talented juried artists and craftspeople will fill Main Street with fine art\, unique crafts\, and creative treasures. \nEnjoy live performances from beloved local musicians throughout the day. Happening under the covered garage at Jonathan’s on Main Street. \n10:30am – Mitch Hampton \n12:00pm – Steve Trisman and Friends \n1:30pm – Maddi and Clarke \n3:00pm – Steelin’ Time \nScreenshot
