SUMMARY:Rock for Relief Venue Fest
DESCRIPTION:We’re excited to be a part of Rock for Relief Venue Fest on Saturday\, September 19th! Join us by the river for an afternoon and evening packed with LIVE MUSIC — all while supporting two great local organizations! \nProceeds benefit the Haywood County Arts Council and REACH of Haywood County\, and the event is part of Arts Weekend!\nCome grab a drink\, enjoy some great live music\, and help us support our community. Five acts. One great cause. All day by the river! \nLIVE MUSIC LINEUP: \n1:00 PM — Emanuel Pino \n2:30 PM — Shane Meade Trio \n3:45 PM — Bombshell \n5:30 PM — Fancy and Friends \n7:30 PM — Rich Manz & The Blast of Brass Band
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/rock-for-relief-venue-fest/
LOCATION:Current Tavern Canton
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Canton/Candler/Leicester,Live Music
END:VEVENT
